234`\n\nSteps:\n1. Create database at both sides(source and target)\n2. Create table at source\n3. Setup DR replication from source to target\n4. Create new table at source\n5. Check the tables at source and target\n\n\n**Noticed**:\n1. Table is created at source \n2. Table is in INITIATED state in master’s xCluster page\n3. Table is not being replicated at target and it shows as Preparing (HIDDEN) state in tables page at target\n4. There are N number of same table is being created and in Preparing (HIDDEN) at target side\n5. Other bad thing is, if user tries to create new table at source when the DR setup is in Initialising state then it will stuck in Initialise state for longer time and later it fails to create DR replication.\n\n**Additional details:**\nSource and Target details are present in respective JIRA ticket.\nIt is 100% repro-able\n\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-15068]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15068?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25778/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25778/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"hulien22","id":32774836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc0ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32774836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22","html_url":"https://github.com/hulien22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c